# kit runtime junk — never track
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# daemon runtime files (socket/pid/log/start_attempt), wherever the daemon
# runs — engine/hooks/ during kit development, .claude/hooks/ if installed
.daemon.*
.claude/settings.local.json
# .memory/cache/ self-ignores via its own tracked .gitignore ("*" + "!.gitignore")
# so the directory survives clones — do NOT add a .memory/cache/ line here.
